---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Creator Growth Tools and its editorial approach.">
  <section class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Independent editorial comparisons for creator tools.</h1>
    <p class="dek">
      Creator Growth Tools is a small independent publication for English-speaking creators and solo businesses
      who want a concise, honest comparison before choosing newsletter and email marketing software.
    </p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
      <p>We separate verified vendor facts from editorial assessment. If we have not used a product first-hand, we do not claim hands-on testing or personal experience.</p>
      <h2>Current scope</h2>
      <p>We cover newsletter, email marketing, and audience growth tools for creators and one-person businesses. We would rather publish a small number of comparisons we can keep verified than a large catalogue we cannot.</p>
      <h2>How this site is funded</h2>
      <p>Some outbound links are affiliate links, and every link is labelled on the page so you can see which is which before you click. Links that are not affiliate links earn us nothing. Affiliate relationships never decide which tool we recommend; see our <a href="/editorial-methodology/">editorial methodology</a> and <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
